@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor WhiteSmoke
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor Black
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor LightBlue

title Transferência de Propriedade - Parte 2: Aprovações, Aceitação e Execução

actor "Instituição\nFinanceira" as IF
actor "Cartório" as Cartorio
actor "Prefeitura" as Prefeitura
participant "Offchain\nConsumer\n(API Pública)" as OC
participant "Blockchain\n(Besu)" as BC
participant "Event\nListener" as EL
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

note over IF, DB
**ESTADO INICIAL:**
Transfer aguardando 3 aprovações
requestHash já definido na blockchain
end note

== Aprovação 1/3: Instituição Financeira ==

IF -> OC: **POST /api/transfers/approve**\n{requestHash: "0x...", institution: "FINANCIAL"}
activate OC
OC -> BC: approveTransferAsFinancial(requestHash)
activate BC
BC -> BC: pendingTransfers[requestHash]\n  .financialApproved = true
BC -> BC: **Emit TransferApproved**\n{requestHash, "FINANCIAL", approver}
BC --> EL: Event detected
deactivate BC
activate EL
EL -> Orch: POST /webhooks/.../transfer-approved
activate Orch
Orch -> DB: Record approval 1/3
deactivate Orch
deactivate EL
deactivate OC

== Aprovação 2/3: Cartório ==

Cartorio -> OC: **POST /api/transfers/approve**\n{requestHash: "0x...", institution: "REGISTRY_OFFICE"}
activate OC
OC -> BC: approveTransferAsRegistryOffice(requestHash)
activate BC
BC -> BC: pendingTransfers[requestHash]\n  .registryOfficeApproved = true
BC -> BC: **Emit TransferApproved**
BC --> EL: Event detected
deactivate BC
activate EL
EL -> Orch: POST /webhooks/.../transfer-approved
activate Orch
Orch -> DB: Record approval 2/3
deactivate Orch
deactivate EL
deactivate OC

== Aprovação 3/3: Prefeitura ==

Prefeitura -> OC: **POST /api/transfers/approve**\n{requestHash: "0x...", institution: "MUNICIPALITY"}
activate OC
OC -> BC: approveTransferAsMunicipality(requestHash)
activate BC
BC -> BC: pendingTransfers[requestHash]\n  .municipalityApproved = true
BC -> BC: **Emit TransferApproved**
BC --> EL: Event detected
deactivate BC
activate EL
EL -> Orch: POST /webhooks/.../transfer-approved
activate Orch
Orch -> DB: Record approval 3/3
deactivate Orch
deactivate EL
deactivate OC

note over BC
**3 aprovações OK**
end note

note over Buyer, DB
**RESULTADO FINAL:**
✅ Transferência concluída
✅ Tokens transferidos: vendedor → comprador
✅ Proprietário atualizado na blockchain
✅ Status transfer: CONCLUIDA
✅ Status propriedade: OK
end note

@enduml
